WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
Sign in securely to access your private job tracker.

00:04.000 --> 00:10.000
The dashboard provides a clear overview of your applications and recent activity.

00:10.000 --> 00:25.000
Capture job listings directly from the browser extension.

00:25.000 --> 00:32.500
Relevant job details are extracted quickly and prepared for review.

00:32.000 --> 00:37.000
After confirmation, the information is saved in its respective section.

00:37.000 --> 00:44.000
The Applications page keeps every opportunity organised and easy to manage.

00:44.000 --> 00:49.000
The dashboard updates automatically as the application count increases from five to seven.